&lt;p&gt;unexcavated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two arouras (.56 ha.). Quarter share given in a &lt;em&gt;donatio mortis causa&lt;/em&gt; by a metropolitan woman to her daughter in 161-169 CE.&lt;/p&gt;
