&lt;p&gt;239 CE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="excavation-dates"&gt;Excavation Dates&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;unexcavated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1 1/8 arouras (.31 ha.). Leased for 3 years in 239 CE. Furnished with well and sakiya. Rent in cash payable in two installments each year.&lt;/p&gt;
