&lt;p&gt;seventh century CE (after 641)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="excavation-dates"&gt;Excavation Dates&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;unexcavated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In an unknown village; size not stated, part of larger tract of 10.5 arouras. Leased by an Arsinoite notable to his cowherd in the seventh century CE (after 641). Contains date palms, sycamores, and perhaps other trees.&lt;/p&gt;
