&lt;h2 id="excavation-dates"&gt;Excavation Dates&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;unexcavated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One-half aroura (.14 ha.). Leased in 69 CE for 3 years. Includes fruit trees of unspecified type (&lt;em&gt;ἀκρόδρυα&lt;/em&gt;), up which vines are trained; vineyard is described as anadendradic. Requires dung and &lt;em&gt;ammos&lt;/em&gt; (sand).&lt;/p&gt;
