&lt;h2 id="excavation-dates"&gt;Excavation Dates&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;unexcavated&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="garden-description"&gt;Garden Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One-half aroura (.14 ha.). Leased on 71 CE for 3 years. Includes fruit trees (apple, perhaps others), up which vines are trained; vineyard is described as anadendradic. Surrounded by mud-brick wall (&lt;em&gt;πλαστή&lt;/em&gt;). Rent of wine plus 1000 apples and amounts of thyme.&lt;/p&gt;
